ONE self-contained index.html. No build step, npm, bundler, TypeScript, JSX,
frameworks, or CDN scripts. Vanilla ES2019. All CSS and JS inline.
It must paste into a DotNetNuke HTML module.
Scope every CSS rule under #ctv5. Never write rules for :root, html, body or *.
No !important. If a rule seems to need it, the selector is wrong.
No server ever receives card data. No analytics SDK, no QR web service, no
database. Share payloads ride in the URL fragment (#p=), never a query string.

PALETTE - exact values, do not substitute Tailwind or shadcn defaults:
--page #0B0E10  --sidebar #0D1114  --panel #101417  --field #0D1215
--divider #1E292D (decorative only)  --control #556772 (input/button borders)
--text #E8EEEB  --muted #78868E  --accent #72A7FF  --ink #0B0E10  --active #131C2D
#58656A and #1E292D fail WCAG contrast. That is why these values exist.

ACCESSIBILITY - WCAG 2.1 AA, not optional:
Focus = 2px solid #CFE2FF at 2px offset PLUS a 2px #0B0E10 inner ring via
box-shadow. The inner ring keeps it visible on accent buttons.
Never style :hover and :focus-visible in the same rule.
Never outline:none without a replacement.
Real <label for> on every input. <nav> with aria-current. Skip link to <main>.
Targets 44px minimum. Body text 4.5:1, control borders 3:1.
